  "content": "<!doctype lake><meta name=\"doc-version\" content=\"1\" /><meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"fixed\" /><meta name=\"typography\" content=\"classic\" /><p data-lake-id=\"uc023d549\" id=\"uc023d549\"><card type=\"inline\" name=\"image\" value=\"data:%7B%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F0%2F2026%2Fpng%2F27903758%2F1785082360387-ba6eded1-9048-4ac2-ba13-e3e505e01c3b.png%22%2C%22taskId%22%3A%22uc69dc04f-5101-4288-90da-a9bd1b17f7d%22%2C%22clientId%22%3A%22uf7d8eb2b-bdfb-4%22%2C%22originalType%22%3A%22binary%22%2C%22width%22%3A836.8%2C%22height%22%3A439%2C%22linkTarget%22%3A%22_blank%22%2C%22name%22%3A%22image.png%22%2C%22size%22%3A809175%2C%22from%22%3A%22paste%22%2C%22originWidth%22%3A1046%2C%22originHeight%22%3A549%2C%22ratio%22%3A1.25%2C%22status%22%3A%22done%22%2C%22style%22%3A%22none%22%2C%22showTitle%22%3Afalse%2C%22title%22%3A%22%22%2C%22rotation%22%3A0%2C%22crop%22%3A%5B0%2C0%2C1%2C1%5D%2C%22averageHue%22%3A%22%23828785%22%2C%22__spacing%22%3A%22both%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22u5926859d%22%2C%22margin%22%3A%7B%22top%22%3Atrue%2C%22bottom%22%3Atrue%7D%7D\"></card></p><p data-lake-id=\"u56bdc90f\" id=\"u56bdc90f\"><span data-lake-id=\"u5fcd928c\" id=\"u5fcd928c\">本项目参考国外知名项目OpenDuck,在结构上和代码层面做了大量的修改。</span></p><p data-lake-id=\"u237912b9\" id=\"u237912b9\"><span data-lake-id=\"ucff3f2bc\" id=\"ucff3f2bc\">​</span><br></p><p data-lake-id=\"ua6e91aa2\" id=\"ua6e91aa2\"><span data-lake-id=\"u58eef1a9\" id=\"u58eef1a9\" class=\"lake-fontsize-12\" style=\"color: rgb(15, 17, 21)\">本系统采用</span><strong><span data-lake-id=\"u33808c92\" id=\"u33808c92\" class=\"lake-fontsize-12\" style=\"color: rgb(15, 17, 21)\">近端策略优化（PPO）强化学习算法</span></strong><span data-lake-id=\"u8da2b765\" id=\"u8da2b765\" class=\"lake-fontsize-12\" style=\"color: rgb(15, 17, 21)\">与轻量化神经网络相结合的控制架构。</span></p><p data-lake-id=\"ub6cfe30c\" id=\"ub6cfe30c\"><strong><span data-lake-id=\"u19679c36\" id=\"u19679c36\" class=\"lake-fontsize-12\" style=\"color: rgb(15, 17, 21)\">网络规模方面</span></strong><span data-lake-id=\"u91a42486\" id=\"u91a42486\" class=\"lake-fontsize-12\" style=\"color: rgb(15, 17, 21)\">，该神经网络仅包含约22万个可学习参数，计算效率极高。经实测，即使在成本受限的树莓派Zero 2W平台上，推理频率仍可达每秒800次，完全满足实时控制需求。</span></p><p data-lake-id=\"u72872fda\" id=\"u72872fda\"><strong><span data-lake-id=\"u0aed00b8\" id=\"u0aed00b8\" class=\"lake-fontsize-12\" style=\"color: rgb(15, 17, 21)\">推理流程方面</span></strong><span data-lake-id=\"u64bd22cf\" id=\"u64bd22cf\" class=\"lake-fontsize-12\" style=\"color: rgb(15, 17, 21)\">，网络以101维观测值作为输入特征，其中包括：蓝牙手柄的操控指令、14个关节舵机的当前角度位置，以及IMU反馈的倾斜角与加速度信息。网络输出为下一时刻14个舵机的目标角度，随后通过PD控制器调节电流，驱动舵机由当前角度平滑旋转至目标角度。</span></p><p data-lake-id=\"u95589397\" id=\"u95589397\"><strong><span data-lake-id=\"u2793820d\" id=\"u2793820d\" class=\"lake-fontsize-12\" style=\"color: rgb(15, 17, 21)\">训练策略方面</span></strong><span data-lake-id=\"uf60fed4d\" id=\"uf60fed4d\" class=\"lake-fontsize-12\" style=\"color: rgb(15, 17, 21)\">，网络在MuJoCo Playground仿真环境中完成训练，通过精心设计的奖励函数引导策略收敛。训练完成后，将仿真中习得的控制策略直接部署至真实物理机器人运行——这一流程即为业内通称的 </span><strong><span data-lake-id=\"ua88c892d\" id=\"ua88c892d\" class=\"lake-fontsize-12\" style=\"color: rgb(15, 17, 21)\">“Sim-to-Real”（仿真到真实迁移）</span></strong><span data-lake-id=\"ub229b668\" id=\"ub229b668\" class=\"lake-fontsize-12\" style=\"color: rgb(15, 17, 21)\"> 流程。</span></p><p data-lake-id=\"u0de280c2\" id=\"u0de280c2\"><span data-lake-id=\"u0a5aff43\" id=\"u0a5aff43\">​</span><br></p><p data-lake-id=\"u48ef3888\" id=\"u48ef3888\"><span data-lake-id=\"u06131726\" id=\"u06131726\">​</span><br></p><table data-lake-id=\"CRMIf\" id=\"CRMIf\" margin=\"true\" width-mode=\"contain\" class=\"lake-table\" style=\"width: 911px\"><colgroup><col width=\"398\"><col width=\"263\"><col width=\"250\"></colgroup><tbody><tr data-lake-id=\"u6eaa15c9\" id=\"u6eaa15c9\"><td data-lake-id=\"udfbd1505\" id=\"udfbd1505\"><p data-lake-id=\"u75d400cc\" id=\"u75d400cc\"><a href=\"https://github.com/apirrone/Open_Duck_Mini\" target=\"_blank\" data-lake-id=\"u2e48fd5e\" id=\"u2e48fd5e\"><span data-lake-id=\"u85c0b746\" id=\"u85c0b746\">https://github.com/apirrone/Open_Duck_Mini</span></a></p></td><td data-lake-id=\"uf8104ef1\" id=\"uf8104ef1\"><p data-lake-id=\"ub384785b\" id=\"ub384785b\"><span data-lake-id=\"ub220c68b\" id=\"ub220c68b\">目录仓库（介绍，3D打印件）</span></p></td><td data-lake-id=\"u24838a5e\" id=\"u24838a5e\"></td></tr><tr data-lake-id=\"u2b0fad88\" id=\"u2b0fad88\"><td data-lake-id=\"ud68b9c5a\" id=\"ud68b9c5a\"><p data-lake-id=\"uef514eed\" id=\"uef514eed\"><a href=\"https://github.com/apirrone/Open_Duck_Mini_Runtime\" target=\"_blank\" data-lake-id=\"u773a6732\" id=\"u773a6732\"><span data-lake-id=\"u5cae035b\" id=\"u5cae035b\">https://github.com/apirrone/Open_Duck_Mini_Runtime</span></a></p></td><td data-lake-id=\"u733db690\" id=\"u733db690\"><p data-lake-id=\"u40993ab0\" id=\"u40993ab0\"><span data-lake-id=\"ube503631\" id=\"ube503631\">真机部署</span></p></td><td data-lake-id=\"u4950e563\" id=\"u4950e563\"><p data-lake-id=\"u7448e967\" id=\"u7448e967\"><span data-lake-id=\"ud1573be4\" id=\"ud1573be4\">硬件ubuntu系统</span></p></td></tr><tr data-lake-id=\"u425afc05\" id=\"u425afc05\"><td data-lake-id=\"u53b8c4b7\" id=\"u53b8c4b7\"><p data-lake-id=\"uc670bddf\" id=\"uc670bddf\"><a href=\"https://github.com/apirrone/Open_Duck_reference_motion_generator\" target=\"_blank\" data-lake-id=\"ud3b11c94\" id=\"ud3b11c94\"><span data-lake-id=\"u32838cf6\" id=\"u32838cf6\">https://github.com/apirrone/Open_Duck_reference_motion_generator</span></a></p></td><td data-lake-id=\"uc46d68da\" id=\"uc46d68da\"><p data-lake-id=\"u0c0929e6\" id=\"u0c0929e6\"><span data-lake-id=\"u5a54ae05\" id=\"u5a54ae05\">步态生成</span></p></td><td data-lake-id=\"u9eccd5e3\" id=\"u9eccd5e3\"><p data-lake-id=\"u24ee1217\" id=\"u24ee1217\"><span data-lake-id=\"u745b04cb\" id=\"u745b04cb\">Ubuntu系统</span></p></td></tr><tr data-lake-id=\"u89904532\" id=\"u89904532\"><td data-lake-id=\"u332e5e8f\" id=\"u332e5e8f\"><p data-lake-id=\"u7342f7d3\" id=\"u7342f7d3\"><a href=\"https://github.com/apirrone/Open_Duck_Playground\" target=\"_blank\" data-lake-id=\"u89334dbd\" id=\"u89334dbd\"><span data-lake-id=\"ue5e544d3\" id=\"ue5e544d3\">https://github.com/apirrone/Open_Duck_Playground</span></a></p></td><td data-lake-id=\"ue0fecf8e\" id=\"ue0fecf8e\"><p data-lake-id=\"u57f794c2\" id=\"u57f794c2\"><span data-lake-id=\"u08c4dec4\" id=\"u08c4dec4\">强化学习</span></p></td><td data-lake-id=\"ud4be0a2c\" id=\"ud4be0a2c\"><p data-lake-id=\"u85cdc1ca\" id=\"u85cdc1ca\"><span data-lake-id=\"u67c49e34\" id=\"u67c49e34\">Ubuntu系统</span></p></td></tr></tbody></table><p data-lake-id=\"u8d3051eb\" id=\"u8d3051eb\"><span data-lake-id=\"u53ffc98b\" id=\"u53ffc98b\">由于国内访问github比较困难，我已经将github仓库同步到了国内gitee</span></p><table data-lake-id=\"DRe3T\" id=\"DRe3T\" margin=\"true\" width-mode=\"contain\" class=\"lake-table\" style=\"width: 911px\"><colgroup><col width=\"398\"><col width=\"263\"><col width=\"250\"></colgroup><tbody><tr data-lake-id=\"u0b4878d9\" id=\"u0b4878d9\"><td data-lake-id=\"uc9531f35\" id=\"uc9531f35\"><p data-lake-id=\"u987e5501\" id=\"u987e5501\"><a href=\"https://gitee.com/xiaokaijun/Open_Duck_Mini\" target=\"_blank\" data-lake-id=\"u99be3415\" id=\"u99be3415\"><span data-lake-id=\"u471055a9\" id=\"u471055a9\">https://gitee.com/xiaokaijun/Open_Duck_Mini</span></a></p></td><td data-lake-id=\"u73004e59\" id=\"u73004e59\"><p data-lake-id=\"uaded2d73\" id=\"uaded2d73\"><span data-lake-id=\"u34ddf9bb\" id=\"u34ddf9bb\">目录仓库（介绍，3D打印件）</span></p></td><td data-lake-id=\"u54aeb393\" id=\"u54aeb393\"></td></tr><tr data-lake-id=\"u463c83b6\" id=\"u463c83b6\"><td data-lake-id=\"ub06d0e1f\" id=\"ub06d0e1f\"><p data-lake-id=\"ub2f72427\" id=\"ub2f72427\"><a href=\"https://gitee.com/xiaokaijun/Open_Duck_Mini_Runtime\" target=\"_blank\" data-lake-id=\"u7a154e32\" id=\"u7a154e32\"><span data-lake-id=\"u7ee164a0\" id=\"u7ee164a0\">https://gitee.com/xiaokaijun/Open_Duck_Mini_Runtime</span></a></p></td><td data-lake-id=\"uc500dda4\" id=\"uc500dda4\"><p data-lake-id